    <p class="key-takeaways__label">The short version</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Do not buy a course until you know the track. A VLSI batch is the wrong purchase for a student who wants a software offer, and the reverse is just as true.</li>
      <li>Free routes such as NPTEL, edX and manufacturer documentation cover much of the content. Pay only for tool access, hardware and someone who reviews your work.</li>
