          <td data-label="What to do">If you applied, practise the 2023 and 2025 Electronics papers that ISRO publishes on the same page. If you missed this cycle, read the advertisement PDF for eligibility and vacancy numbers before the next one.</td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
