  <h2 id="institute-test">Before you pay a training institute</h2>

  <p>
    Some paid programmes do add value, especially where a college cannot supply tools or feedback. Many do not.
    The information is largely free, so the fee has to buy something else: tools, hardware, a structured order of
    topics, or review of your work.
  </p>

  <div class="mistakes-list">
    {institutePoints.map((item) => (
